{
  "_OFFER_KEYS_DOCS": [
    "To feature a dish in the top Deals of the Day rail, add TWO optional keys to that dish:",
    "  offer_price (number) — fake higher MRP; must be strictly greater than price. Renders strikethrough.",
    "  is_offer (boolean, true) — include this dish in the horizontal Deals rail at the top of the menu.",
    "Behaviour: both keys => dish appears in Deals rail AND its normal category card shows a red X% OFF badge + strikethrough MRP.",
    "Only offer_price (no is_offer) => ignored on the index page — neither strikethrough nor OFF badge renders. is_offer:true is required to advertise any discount.",
    "Only is_offer (no offer_price) => ignored (console.warn) — nothing to strike through.",
    "Percent OFF is computed as round((offer_price - price) / offer_price * 100). Cart still charges the real price.",
    "Example: {\"id\": 105, \"name\": \"Honey Chilli Potato\", \"price\": 179, \"offer_price\": 229, \"is_offer\": true}"
  ],
